# Phase 18 compatibility release gate — 2026-10-22 03:48:50 UTC

Base revision: `96fe5218`. This entry records the request 3002 `updateUser`
Broker RPC slice. Pinned Java source is
`efa1be59d6fc747ad220f036c86030f05f0419f9`.

## Compatibility changes

- Added nullable `UpdateUserRequestHeader` with Java's no-op `checkFields()`
  behavior and included it in the typed-header inventory and Java/Rust frame
  cross-decode.
- Added `MQClientApi::update_user` for request 3002 using the existing `UserInfo`
  Java body encoding, caller timeout, Broker error mapping, and the supplied
  Broker address unchanged when VIP channels are enabled.
- Added invoked Java/Rust cases for populated/default/null-username values,
  success, Broker rejection, exact body bytes, timeout, and VIP-enabled
  unchanged-address behavior.
- Updated request-code and Phase 6 API/reverse-audit documentation. The
  direct-operation reverse audit now has 6 open rows; wider Phase 18 work
  remains open.

